    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis is a residential site extending to approximately 0.33 acres (0.13 hectares) situated in the townland of Ballinvinny, approximately 10 minutes from Glanmire and east of the M8 Cork to Dublin Motorway.\n\nThe property enjoys extensive frontage onto the public road (L2972) and is located in a peaceful rural setting surrounded by agricultural lands and scattered detached residences. The site is level in nature and benefits from attractive countryside views.\n\nServices would be by means of a private water supply and on-site wastewater treatment system (bio-cycle unit or septic tank), subject to the necessary consents.\n\nThis well-located site offers an opportunity to develop a private residence in a sought-after rural location while remaining within convenient reach of Glanmire, Cork City and a wide range of amenities. The site is situated in the “Metropolitan Green Belt” under the Cork County Development Plan 2022-2024. Applicants must prove an exceptional, rural-generated housing need based on strict social or economic links to the local area. \n\nThe Site is located adjacent Eircode: T45 KH26\n\nFolio Number: CK43301"
      },
